1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:05,140
Every fitness app makes you type. This one, you just talk to.

2
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:09,220
You: "Alexa, I had two rotis, chicken curry and a mango lassi for lunch."

3
00:00:12,410 --> 00:00:16,000
Alexa: I assumed one bowl of chicken curry and one glass of mango lassi.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,910
Alexa: You have 1,153 calories left today.

5
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,740
You: "Actually, make that one roti."

6
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:28,440
Alexa: You have 1,272 calories left today.

7
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,680
You: "Alexa, start push day."

8
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,870
Alexa: Set one is 80 kilos for eight reps.

9
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:38,050
You: "Done, eight reps."

10
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:46,970
Alexa: New PR! Bench 101.3 kilos. Set two: 80 kg, eight reps.

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,220
You: "My shoulder feels off. Swap the overhead press."

12
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:58,560
Alexa: I have swapped overhead press for landmine press. Set one is 32.5 kilos for six reps.

13
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:02,990
You: "Plan my meal prep for the next four days and add what I need to my cart."

14
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:11,650
Alexa: Add 12 items, about $112, to your Amazon cart?

15
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:13,970
You: "Yes."

16
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:22,930
Alexa: The total is $112.44. The Amazon link is on screen.

17
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:27,500
Alexa: Your meal prep plan is ready.

18
00:01:28,030 --> 00:01:31,000
Alexa: The details are on your screen.

19
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,100
[The next morning]

20
00:01:34,570 --> 00:01:35,770
You: "Alexa, good morning."

21
00:01:39,970 --> 00:01:45,300
Alexa: Good morning. Today is leg day, starting with back squats at 102.5 kilos.

22
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:48,720
You: "How's my bench going?"

23
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:56,520
Alexa: Your bench has improved by 9.5 kilos, ending at 101.3 kilos.

24
00:01:57,490 --> 00:02:02,980
Every turn is a real MCP call: protocol 2025-11-25 over Streamable HTTP, 18 tools.

25
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:09,390
The server runs on AgentCore Runtime, with Aurora Serverless v2 and an overnight Lambda.

26
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:23,810
Nova 2.5 Sonic is Alexa's voice. Nova 2 Lite makes the judgment calls; code checks every number.

27
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:32,100
Every fitness app makes you type. This one, you just talk to.
